@Secretariat_HostAddress = https://localhost:7102

### Un student înmatriculat
GET {{Secretariat_HostAddress}}/enrollment/SIM-2026-0412
Accept: application/json

### O înmatriculare expirată
GET {{Secretariat_HostAddress}}/enrollment/SIM-2024-0107
Accept: application/json

### Un matricol care nu există
GET {{Secretariat_HostAddress}}/enrollment/SIM-0000-0000
Accept: application/json
